velNote:"One per person in each product. It is not a role in any organization, and organization members do not need one.",orgLevel:"Organization role",orgLevelNote:"A separate role in every organization and in every product, so a person can be an admin in Pay and a viewer in Host.",subscription:"Monthly subscription",personalAccess:"Personal access",billingUnchanged:"No billing change",payBilling:"Pay User access is assigned by a Founder. It opens My systems and My organizations without creating a subscription or changing billing. Organization roles are assigned separately.",noSubscription:"No subscription",free:"Free",you:"You",billingTitle:"Who pays?",billing:"Only a User pays a monthly subscription, for the systems in their plan. Founders are exempt, and organization roles \u2014 owner included \u2014 never pay and never see billing on their own. An owner sees the organization's billing only when they are also its subscribing User.",matrix:"What each organization role can do",permission:"Permission",managementTitle:"What is platform management?",managementLead:"Platform management is the Founders' console for running WIFIGATE For Business. It is separate from every organization's workspace.",managementItems:[["people","People and plans","Add, block and remove Founders and Users in Host, Pay and Manager. Each plan is per product."],["shield","Organizations","Create and remove organizations, see their owners and employees, and switch products on or off for them."],["card","Subscriptions","Monthly estimates for billable subscriptions. Founders are exempt; organization employees never pay for their membership. Pay User access does not create a subscription."]],managementBoundary:"Platform management never opens an organization's own data. Inside an organization, a Founder acts only by the organization role they hold there.",yourRole:"Your role in this organization",noRole:"You have no role in this organization",canDo:"You can",cannotDo:"Only higher roles can",allRole